// 1) Roll a 20-D for Wind, Temperature, & Preceipitation. 
// 2) If there is a precipitation & no wind, roll a 20-D for Fog.
// 3) If the number rolled is less than or equal to the number on the chart, then that situation is occurring.
// 4) Go to the Weather/Turf Effects section to find the effects of each condition. 
// 5) Add all effects.
// Note: Cities not listed here play in domes and have no weather effects

// Wind Key
// W1 = Gusty
// W2 = Strong
// W3 = Gailing

// Temperature Key
// b = boiling
// h = hot
// c = cold
// f = freezing

// Note1: When Denver plays on the road, reverse Altitude effects for Denver only
// Note2: Do not make and adjustment for Endurance on Denver players (home or road).

